  "bodyText": "Home\nVisit Us\nExhibitions\nEvents\nOnline Talks\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nCollections\nBlog\nResearch\nLearning\nShop\nCart\nMy Account\nAbout\nBecome a Friend\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\n\n01993 810 210\n\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\n  \nHome\nEvents\nExhibitions\nCollections\nFriends’ Membership\nVisit\nShop\nBasket\nMy Account\nOxfordshire’s Military Heritage in 50 Objects\nResearch\nLearning\nOnline Talks\nBlog\nSupport Us\nRoom Hire\nImage Services\nAbout\nBooks\nGifts\nRemembered: The Men on the War Memorials of Witney, Crawley and Hailey. Volume 2: 1939-1945.\n£9.99\n\nRemembered: The Men on the War Memorials of Witney, Crawley and Hailey. Volume 2: 1939-1945. quantity\nAdd to Cart\n\nJeff Clements gives an extensive and full description of the stories of individual mean named on the Witney, Crawley and Hailey World War 2 memorials. Featuring multiple diary entry accounts, as well as a number of photographs of the soldiers alongside a contextual description of what was happening on various fronts at the time they served.\n\nPaperback, 170 pages.\n\nContents\n\n1: Introduction\n\n3: Context\n\n5: The World War 2 Extension to the Witney War Memorial\n\n140: The Crawley War Memorial\n\n148: The Hailey War Memorial\n\n153: Acknowledgements\n\n155: Appendices\n\n-Those Not Named on the Memorials (155)\n\n-Roll of Honour, 1st Witney Coy. Boys Brigade\n\n-Private Frederick J. Hunt, Crawley\n\n-Appeal Letter from the W.U.D.C. March 1950\n\n-Cemeteries and Memorials Mentioned\n\n165: Sources and Select Bibliography\n\n169: Index\n\nISBN: 9780957577312\n\nRelated products\nWinston Churchill: Oxfordshire Hussar – A Bugle & Sabre Special\n£2.00 Add to cart\nThe Skipper’s War: Dragon School, Oxford & The Great War\n£20.00 Add to cart\nBritish Army Cap Badges of the First World War\n£14.99 Add to cart\nIdentifying Cap Badges: A Family Historian’s Guide\n£25.00 Add to cart\n\nSoldiers of Oxfordshire Museum\nPark Street.\nWoodstock\nOxfordshire OX20 1SN\n\nPhone and Email:\nGeneral Enquiries & Event Tickets: 01993 810 211\nfrontofhouse@sofo.org.uk\n\nPrivacy Policy\nTerms and conditions",
